[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0010","text":"甜花的角色是……\n三姐妹中的，幺妹……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0020","text":"在剧里……是……\n爱撒娇的……妹妹……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0030","text":"……看来甜花对这点特别上心啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0040","text":"嘿嘿……\n要跟两个人……尽情撒娇……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0050","text":"因为甜花，是妹妹……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0060","text":"哈哈……\n身边就有甘奈在，不是正好可以当作演技参考吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0070","text":"嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0080","text":"平时的，小奈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0090","text":"……咦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_01_0100","text":"小奈……\n虽然是妹妹，但很可靠……"}]
